#: __init__.py:749
msgid "When enabled, root bones without parents (anchor bones such as the head or torso) get no constraint; only their descendant chains are processed."
msgstr "启用后，没有父级的根骨骼（如头部或躯干等锚点骨骼）不会添加约束；仅处理其后代骨骼链。"

#: __init__.py:811
msgid "When re-running Batch Add, update constraints the add-on already created to the current parameters. On = full refresh; off = keep existing constraints, only add to bones without them."
msgstr "重新运行批量添加时，将插件已创建的约束更新为当前参数。开启 = 完全刷新；关闭 = 保留现有约束，仅为没有约束的骨骼添加。"

